      RECONCILED ORG -> REPO ON 2026-08-14 BEFORE EDITING. A retrieve from usman-dpeg was diffed
      against this file: 63 fieldPermissions on both sides, identical sets; no
      recordTypeVisibilities on either side. Zero org-only grants. (The <viewAllFields> element
      in the org retrieve is an API-added default, not drift.)

      ADDED 2026-08-14, Acquisition Observations Phase 1 (deploy step P1-A): FOUR grants -
      Opportunity.Listing_Status__c, .Extraction_Score_Pct__c, .Fields_Captured_Count__c and
      .Fields_Missing_Count__c. All editable=false, readable=true.

      ⚠ OPPORTUNITY ONLY, AND THE ABSENCE OF THE LEAD TWINS IS DELIBERATE. This is the layer-3b
      Opportunity SUBSET set - it exists so the Transactions team can read deals without
      inheriting the rest of Acquisitions (ARCHITECTURE.md, seven-layer permission model:
      "Subset != duplicate"). Adding the Lead-side grants here would quietly widen it into the
      Lead module and defeat the reason the set exists.

      🔴 A green field deploy does NOT imply FLS. Verify in the ORG:
          SELECT Field FROM FieldPermissions WHERE Parent.Name = 'DPEG_Opportunity_View'
      must move 63 -> 67, with the four fields above present.

      Full sequence: agent-output/runbook-acquisition-observations-phase1.md

      P8 HUB PASS (2026-08-30): count moves 67 -> 69 with two more read-only formula grants,
      Opportunity.BP_Expiry__c and Opportunity.Days_in_System__c (WS2). See
      agent-output/ba-gap-closure-p8-hub-pass.md §1.
    -->
